{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1000_204xxx", "source_sha256": "2648bc9155be2fe9608fc5174f73e7cf1f980923eabd0154ee5489dbb26f1713", "ja": "どもども～♪　『レイジー・レイジー』の\nレイジーの方、フレちゃんでーす。よろしくね～♪", "zh": "嗨嗨～♪我是《Lazy Lazy》里Lazy的那位，芙蕾～请多关照哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1001_null", "source_sha256": "8683cb77fae45e81efa1190eb86b51ce028ac1a414c7b7b7216b5e1873242e16", "ja": "ワアアアァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e74c06061416b4d494607309087890d0abd421eb37c858e23533da595e6590de", "ja": "（コラボの一環として、劇場公演にフレデリカが出て\nくれる事になった！　お客さんの反応も上々だ）", "zh": "（作为合作的一环，芙蕾德莉卡要来剧场公演演出了！客人的反响也相当不错）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1003_204xxx", "source_sha256": "5740ad78be43ad388cb2dd767ba77e33c79a28b069fde2135c05ea1905888f80", "ja": "ふぅ～、お疲れさまさま～！\n{$P$}さま、しるぶぷれ～♪", "zh": "呼～辛苦啦辛苦啦～！\n{$P$}先生，拜托啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b19e9d5acb1486523663b18383c5f481db578ac0c26b85278153e5e28b080c48", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま！\nどうだった？　今日のステージは。", "zh": "啊，辛苦了！\n怎么样？今天的舞台还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1005_204xxx", "source_sha256": "1f98ba88e2d900d78759f10df7f2e8961199092db6119a320b7e95924f1c125d", "ja": "もちろん、楽しかったよっ。\nお客さん達、みーんな笑顔だったし！", "zh": "当然开心啦。\n因为客人们全都笑容满面的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1006_204xxx", "source_sha256": "d5e31d938bc6e91a89905ff9459d46c1f60b1f0a639e087a495f4dc144228639", "ja": "いいね～、この劇場。ファンがアイドルに\n会いたくなったら、いつでも会える！", "zh": "真不错呢～，这个剧场。粉丝想见偶像的时候，\n随时都能见到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1007_204xxx", "source_sha256": "9b79537178caff667e214f0eda33d86e1159a6a42f515012611c347e70b3bcab", "ja": "よっ、大将、いつものやつ！　みたいな？\n気楽なケーキ屋さん、みたいな～。", "zh": "哟，大将，还是老样子！——类似这种？\n就像一家让人感到轻松自在的蛋糕店～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3271f0accceb84fdd12e6fb30fcf3b0c20b5499e3b342435c321c4ab3d6aa72a", "ja": "なるほど。だんだんわからなくなってきたけど……\nそっちの事務所とは、やっぱり色々違う？", "zh": "原来如此。虽然感觉越来越搞不懂了……  \n和你们那边的事务所，果然还是有很多不同吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1009_204xxx", "source_sha256": "47b4741c11ba764612c242ecdf44b0e368b2eee9fd308afd3cdd6f1d9e0516d3", "ja": "違うトコもあるし、似てるトコもあるし？\nつまりどっちもサイコーってことで♪", "zh": "有不一样的地方，也有相似的地方？\n总之两边都是最棒的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1010_204xxx", "source_sha256": "a978a1881545ed97fda7ef1acda0b32539a94182e380de7f966d2e578840d775", "ja": "ファンのみんながいてくれて～、\n楽しんでくれるなら～、なんでもオッケーだよ♪", "zh": "有粉丝们陪着我～，\n只要大家能开心～，怎么样都没问题哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1011_p", "source_sha256": "59bc53aa19099697a5370aa7f5b66321bb15d8dd050b78aaf84e793ef979c36e", "ja": "うん、そう言ってもらえてよかった。\n勝手が違うんじゃないかって、心配してたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，你能这么说真是太好了。\n我之前还担心你可能会觉得环境不一样，不太适应呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1012_204xxx", "source_sha256": "ee483bbe680d970d0a7de17150f8214a2204bc73ecc3674bee77c8bd1bd03853", "ja": "んー？　大丈夫だって。\nフレちゃん、こう見えてかなり高いから。", "zh": "嗯——？没问题的啦。\n芙蕾别看这样，其实适应力很强的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1013_204xxx", "source_sha256": "4c525fcdf329920881481776f3978f97696e08833f26d1f5ee8f571fe0d3bd11", "ja": "テキオーりょく……ジュンノーりょく？　そういうの。\nお、ジュンノーってフランス語っぽい。ジュンノー♪", "zh": "适应力……顺应力？就是那种。哦，“俊诺”听起来像法语。“俊诺”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3b4be224c746ac13adb02c08a73f8cfdb4ea471c36bd28c8cf07441c052ab5aa", "ja": "順応か。確かに君は、\n誰とでもすぐ仲良くなれそうな印象があるかな。", "zh": "适应能力啊。确实，你给人的印象就是好像能很快和任何人成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1015_204xxx", "source_sha256": "1d45aa8f2b5b314fefe08cb0f9d7ea60a29aae479e4328def2ebf37a8b4ca8bd", "ja": "ホント？　だったら嬉しいな～。\n世界中のみーんなと、友達になってみたいから。", "zh": "真的？那我可开心啦～  \n因为我想和全世界的每一个人都成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1016_204xxx", "source_sha256": "91949fb51d146f39b519acc66bc1221abccd4ef03555b20e8c00073778580345", "ja": "フランスと日本に比べたらさ～、\n事務所同士なんて、ご近所でしょ？　ぼんじゅ～る♪", "zh": "和法国、日本相比，事务所之间不就是邻居嘛～？你好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1017_p", "source_sha256": "21096c76f6bccfd2e39379d387a2e1d079fc58b1f1af3a20a670df12e2eae07c", "ja": "そうだな……そう思うよ。\nよし、その調子で、この劇場も盛り上げてくれ！", "zh": "是啊……我也这么觉得。\n好，就照这个劲头，把这个剧场也炒热起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1018_204xxx", "source_sha256": "e6e56f217eb60a86ccc62c9ba65b47deeea9c365448fe2162a02c01b57b488c4", "ja": "おっけー！　んじゃさっそく……。\n勝手にアンコール♪　おーい、みんな～！", "zh": "好嘞！那就马上开始……  \n自作主张来个安可♪——喂——大家～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_204xxx0013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_204xxx0013_1019_p", "source_sha256": "435864086435f56f6ffc6d875be4c344b47fea7984538ba016a74e46905e7879", "ja": "えっ？　いや、もう退場が始まっ……", "zh": "诶？不，已经开始退场了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
